     "page": 1,
     "text": "Marsh Inc Medical Group\nRe: Lisa Lowe (DOB 09/16/1986)\n\nApril 27, 2026\n\nToday, I saw Ms. Lisa in the clinic for follow-up of her Heart failure / cardiomyopathy. Her blood pressure today was 112/90 her weight was 141 pounds. Overall, she is doing well. She is currently on spironolactone 25 mg and carvedilol 6.25 mg. Her ejection fraction is stable at 52%. This condition has been under control for approximately 4.1 years now.\n\nNovember 21, 2025\n\nMs. Lowe was seen for a follow-up regarding her Heart failure / cardiomyopathy. On this visit, her blood pressure was 104/87, and her weight was 141 pounds. Ms. Lowe has a known history of Heart failure / cardiomyopathy with an ejection fraction of 52%. She has been stable for approximately 4.1 years. She is currently taking spironolactone 25 mg and carvedilol 6.25 mg.\n\nJune 16, 2025\n\nMs. Lowe presented for a routine follow-up of her Heart failure / cardiomyopathy. Her blood pressure was 103/86, and her weight was 148 pounds. She has a known history of Heart failure / cardiomyopathy with an ejection fraction of 52%. This condition has been stable for about 4.1 years now. She is on spironolactone 25 mg and carvedilol 6.25 mg.\n\nJanuary 10, 2025\n\nMs. Lowe visited for a URI. Her blood pressure was 119/88, and her weight was 151 pounds. Despite the URI, her known Heart failure / cardiomyopathy with an ejection fraction of 52% remains stable. She has been stable for around 4.1 years. She continues to take spironolactone 25 mg and carvedilol 6.25 mg.\n\nAugust 5, 2024\n\nMs. Lowe was seen today for Heart failure / cardiomyopathy. Her blood pressure was 116/83, and her weight was 156 pounds. She has a known history of Heart failure / cardiomyopathy with an ejection fraction of 52%. This condition has been stable for approximately 4.1 years. Her medications include spironolactone 25 mg and carvedilol 6.25 mg.\n\nFebruary 29, 2024\n\nMs. Lowe presented for a follow-up regarding Heart failure / cardiomyopathy. Her blood pressure was 118/86, and her weight was 142 pounds. She is doing well and stable. Her known Heart failure / cardiomyopathy with an ejection fraction of 52% has been stable for about 4.1 years. She is currently on spironolactone 25 mg and carvedilol 6.25 mg.\n\nSocial History:\n\nMs. Lowe consumes alcohol approximately two drinks per week.\n\nDr. Alison Bray\nCardiology\nMarsh Inc Medical Group\n"
